 con antecedentes de hemorragia gástrica y que toman anticoagulantes o hormonas deben consultar a un médico antes de tomar analgésicos como el ibuprofeno"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/34-04"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["04"]},"Para niños menores de 2 años con resfriado, no les den por su cuenta medicamentos combinados para el resfriado ni antitusivos"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/34-05"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["05"]},"Después de las 20 semanas de gestación, no tome por cuenta propia analgésicos como el ibuprofeno"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/34-06"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["06"]},"Si tiene acidez o ardor de estómago, puede comprar omeprazol por su cuenta, pero no lo tome más de 7 días; si presenta dificultad para tragar, vómitos con sangre o heces negras, acuda directamente al hospital"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/34-07"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["07"]},"Para el resfriado común, no pida antibióticos al médico"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/34-08"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["08"]},"Para la diarrea, lo primero es hidratar con sales de rehidratación oral; no se deben dar medicamentos antidiarreicos a niños menores de 5 años"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/34-09"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["09"]},"No se debe tomar analgésicos durante más de 15 días al mes; si se trata de analgésicos combinados, el límite es de 10 días. De lo contrario, el dolor de cabeza podría ser consecuencia del propio medicamento"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/34-10"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["10"]},"Retire con regularidad medicamentos caducados y sin usar; deséchelos con el envase en contenedores de residuos peligrosos, no en casa a la ligera"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"aria-current":"page","className":"active","href":"/es/tip/34-11","data-status":"active"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["11"]},"Mientras toma cefalosporinas, metronidazol y antibacterianos similares, y durante 7 días después de suspenderlos, evite el alcohol — incluido el de Huoxiang Zhengqi oral liquid y jarabes para la tos"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-tip-page"},"children":[{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-breadcrumb","aria-label":"Ruta de navegación"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/book"},"children":["Libro"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"aria-hidden":"true"},"children":["/"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/book/34"},"children":["Capítulo 34"," ·"," ","No se intoxiquen con los medicamentos que tienen en casa"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-entry-card status-unmarked is-standalone","id":"34-11"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-top"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-entry-number"},"children":["11"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-evidence grade-b"},"children":["Evidencia"," ","B"]}]},{"tag":"h1","props":{"lang":"es"},"children":["Mientras toma cefalosporinas, metronidazol y antibacterianos similares, y durante 7 días después de suspenderlos, evite el alcohol — incluido el de Huoxiang Zhengqi oral liquid y jarabes para la tos"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"lang":"es","className":"life-entry-summary"},"children":["Algunas cefalosporinas y el metronidazol pueden provocar enrojecimiento, palpitaciones, opresión en el pecho y vómitos mezclados con alcohol; en casos graves baja la presión arterial. No solo cuenta cerveza y licores — también Huoxiang Zhengqi y jarabes para la tos con alcohol. Evite el alcohol desde el inicio del fármaco hasta 7 días después de la última dosis."]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-impact"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Coste"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["Sin dinero. Absténgase de alcohol poco más de una semana;"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Beneficio"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["Es una reacción tipo disulfiram. Una divulgación sobre seguridad de medicamentos de 2023 de la Administración…"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-actions","aria-label":"Marcar: Mientras toma cefalosporinas, metronidazol y antibacterianos similares, y durante 7 días después de suspenderlos, evite el alcohol — incluido el de Huoxiang Zhengqi oral liquid y jarabes para la tos"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action done","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"},"children":[]}]},"Hecho"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action todo","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-list-todo","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"rect","props":{"x":"3","y":"5","width":"6","height":"6","rx":"1"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m3 17 2 2 4-4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 6h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 12h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 18h8"},"children":[]}]},"Por hacer"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action favorite","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-bookmark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m19 21-7-4-7 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16z"},"children":[]}]},"Guardar"]}," ",{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"social-share-trigger"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-share2 lucide-share-2","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"5","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"6","cy":"12","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"19","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"8.59","x2":"15.42","y1":"13.51","y2":"17.49"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"15.41","x2":"8.59","y1":"6.51","y2":"10.49"},"children":[]}]},"Compartir consejo"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-detail-toggle","aria-expanded":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"Ocultar detalles"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Coste"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["Sin dinero. Absténgase de alcohol poco más de una semana; revise en la etiqueta de otros medicamentos si contienen etanol."]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Beneficio"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["Es una reacción tipo disulfiram. Una divulgación sobre seguridad de medicamentos de 2023 de la Administración de Productos Médicos de la provincia de Fujian indica que beber antes o después de algunas cefalosporinas puede desencadenar esta reacción, «que puede dañar gravemente la salud o ser mortal». Síntomas: rubor facial, sudor, palpitaciones, incluso disnea, hipotensión y shock anafiláctico. Citando la información clínica de medicamentos de la Farmacopea china, los fármacos listados incluyen cefazolin, ceftriaxone, cefoperazone, metronidazole, tinidazole, furazolidone, entre otros. El artículo indica «sin alcohol ni medicamentos o alimentos con alcohol durante 7 días después de la dosis», con ejemplos de chocolates con licor y Huoxiang Zhengqi oral liquid, porque la enzima inhibida a menudo necesita 4 a 5 días para recuperarse. Un hospital de Guangzhou resumió 82 casos en 2 años: cefalosporinas causaron 57 casos (69,51%), nitroimidazoles (metronidazole, tinidazole) 10 casos (12,20%). Alcohol de bebidas 40 casos (48,78%), de medicamentos con etanol 31 casos (37,80%) — incluidos Huoxiang Zhengqi oral liquid, jarabe para la tos y extracto de motherwort. De 82 casos, 68 leves, 9 moderados, 5 graves; alivio en 1–3 horas; sin muertes. El etiquetado de metronidazol en EE. UU. exige no alcohol durante el tratamiento y al menos 3 días después, ni productos con propylene glycol."]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Fuentes originales"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["福建省药品监督管理局（福建省药品科普与监管数据中心）(2023). 2023年“全国安全用药月”原创科普小知识——为什么吃头孢不能喝酒. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://yjj.scjgj.fujian.gov.cn/ztzl/kpzl/qgaqyyy/202312/t20231215_6334595.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://yjj.scjgj.fujian.gov.cn/ztzl/kpzl/qgaqyyy/202312/t20231215_6334595.htm"]},"；房财富, 涂星, 刘韬, 黄红兵, 邱孟, 梁蔚婷 (2015). 我院双硫仑样反应82例分析. 中国药房, 26(29):4089-4091. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.6039/j.issn.1001-0408.2015.29.19","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.6039/j.issn.1001-0408.2015.29.19"]},"；Pfizer (2026). FLAGYL 375 (metronidazole) capsules, prescribing information: Contraindications, Interaction with Alcohol. DailyMed. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=a2883ca1-5a9a-4259-9d80-46ab67274384","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=a2883ca1-5a9a-4259-9d80-46ab67274384"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://yjj.scjgj.fujian.gov.cn/ztzl/kpzl/qgaqyyy/202312/t20231215_6334595.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"life-source-link"},"children":["Abrir fuente"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"13","height":"13","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M15 3h6v6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M10 14 21 3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Nota del autor"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-content-reference"},"children":["No todas las cefalosporinas reaccionan, pero quien no es experto no las distingue — siga esta regla con cualquier curso de cefalosporina o metronidazol. Diga al médico si bebió recientemente cuando se recetan. La divulgación también sugiere evitar alcohol 3 días antes de la dosis, señalando que no hay intervalo oficial único. Si empiezan rubor o palpitaciones, deje todo alcohol al instante; casos leves pueden resolverse solos, graves requieren hospital. No beba alcohol con acetaminophen — punto 1 de esta sección. Grado B porque la evidencia son series de casos y etiquetado, no ensayos controlados. Beneficio pequeño: los 82 casos se recuperaron en horas, sin muertes, solo 5 graves."]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Mi nota"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["Escribe un recordatorio…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/es/tip/34-10"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["Anterior"]},"Retire con regularidad medicamentos caducados y sin usar; deséchelos con el envase en contenedores de residuos peligrosos, no en casa a la ligera"]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["Más en este tema"]},{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/es/tip/34-04"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["Para niños menores de 2